docs/rnaas_cb_flag_audit.md
docs/rnaas_cb_flag_draft.md
docs/cb_flag_paper.tex
docs/cb_flag_paper.pdf
docs/cb_flag_paper.aux
docs/cb_flag_paper.log
docs/cb_flag_paper.out
docs/cb_flag_paper.bbl

# Grant/collaborator pitch and strategy notes. Kept private while seeking an
