docs/project_pitch.md

# Private working list for the "Could you live here?" survival feature (review menu).
docs/survival_feature_candidates.md

# Private planning list of next atmospheric-enrichment deep-dive targets.
docs/atmosphere_deep_dive_candidates.md

# Deep-dive tracker / enrichment playbook — kept out of new commits so the
